{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "9da2f116e43f72f69092ad1a9258ba8389b64fbc0d6eb49e7e8a4eb8797a4d33", "ja": "目指せ！恋愛番長！", "zh": "目标是！恋爱高手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c224118b2717d41410ed9ee9bce60b82622092a84658201d9375c679109a56ca", "ja": "まだ3人に足りない要素…それは恋愛！\n翼、茜、可憐は、プロデューサーに迫って\nハートを射止めるという勝負をする。だが\n逆にドキドキさせられてしまい、経験不足を\n痛感。無念のプリンを食べる。", "zh": "三位偶像还欠缺一个要素……就是恋爱！\n翼、茜、可怜展开攻势，\n比赛谁能获得制作人的芳心。\n不过，三人反而被弄得心跳加速，\n深感自己经验不足，只好悔恨地吃布丁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "20c508454b4f335fd13d3a1778f391c7bf965f4320dbe3598cb0b43264c0d308", "ja": "（いよいよ、『りるきゃん』のグラビア撮影の日が\n決まったぞ。みんなに、頑張ってもらわないとな！）", "zh": "（《莉露甜心》的写真照拍摄日终于敲定了。\n希望她们努力拿出好表现！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2b8e4b0b589f1f431a7d7a7834fddf7cb278b09fd22f6424e77333a74a82fa6e", "ja": "可憐さん、茜ちゃん。ショップで超カワイイ\nアイテムも買ったし、メイクも習ったけど……。", "zh": "可怜、小茜，我们虽然去店里买了超可爱的单品，\n也学会怎么化妆了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "636c183702af01cc8a2a1a6abb15490d4497a7d78aa3dd39883d431892635160", "ja": "わたし達、まだ大事なコト、してないよね？", "zh": "但我们有件重要的事情还没做吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "a316be81f7e8806b024482c1d76409866bd3cbe666bc7fef13127b502b5f37e3", "ja": "だ、大事なこと……？\n翼ちゃん、それって、なんでしょう……？", "zh": "重、重要的事情……？\n小翼，请问是、什么事呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "ccd3255eee7bfdee40eb9a48d24078a9bcd8d03bc900e25c82fc17699935c9ad", "ja": "ハッ！　もしかして……。\n茜ちゃん人形の、りるきゃんコラボ！？", "zh": "啊！莫非……\n是小茜娃娃要和《莉露甜心》联名合作！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c55c02093811c31b3c676c7cd9086950df464a03586c08d252b47cde5a3568b4", "ja": "も～、全然違うよ～！\n少女漫画といえば、大切なことがあるでしょ？", "zh": "真是的～完全不对啦～！\n说到少女漫画，不是有件很重要的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c671c0a43ea41888dccaf7c542f83a5affc6cdcdcb64733f81e97a9eb1bf096d", "ja": "そう！　少女漫画といえば、恋愛要素ですよ！\nれ・ん・あ・い！", "zh": "没错！说到少女漫画，就不能不提恋爱要素！\n恋、爱、要、素！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "4aa9957d7bcb79e82d9a857f477dd98f75843c2dfb526308696ba1ff8f90440e", "ja": "恋愛、要素……。\n……え。ええ～～～～っ！！？", "zh": "恋爱、要素……\n……咦？咦咦～～～～！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1011_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b78b00e2641f76938b2182452a85d7cf1baeef97a7a9c6d973f5d7b3a390c452", "ja": "おっ、3人とも揃ってるな？\nよかった、探してたんだよ。", "zh": "喔！你们三个都在吗？\n太好了，我正要找你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4fda7c6d117e45eaf74a5d2807622a0c46eac00a84897a0b6124d57ddefba79f", "ja": "『りるきゃん』のグラビア撮影の日が決まったんだ。\n詳細はここに書いておいたから、各自……。", "zh": "拍摄《莉露甜心》写真照的日期已经敲定了。\n详情都写在这上面，你们各自……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2c7bbc7a213e01b296d0be8a86969775ea5e05594906e7bc8e90a3de2ddc2b9d", "ja": "はーい！　わかりました！　だから\n{$P$}さんは、あっちいってて～！", "zh": "遵命──！我们知道了！\n所以，{$P$}先生，请你闪边去～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4e3a2e27f8650093abbd840a740efc5c4f8b181ad3b5c26415b5e2adb70ee311", "ja": "な、なんだ？　来たばかりなのに。\nさては、俺に隠して何かやってたんじゃ……。", "zh": "怎、怎么了？我才刚来耶。\n我知道了，你们是不是有事情瞒着我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "61d8313f58f23b1476c419a926bc10e1902f50725ae1e221bb7429e25b010eae", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん！　茜ちゃん、今唐突に\nとてつもなくプリンが食べたくなって来ちゃった！", "zh": "小{$P$}！\n小茜现在突然非常想吃布丁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "4b640a11f6b024859866ddac4589d8b6986ad7e51e8bd319b0e1d6444de92f81", "ja": "ぷ、プリンを食べないと……茜ちゃんは……\nうう、もう……ダメ……パタリ。", "zh": "如、如果吃不到布丁……小茜就……\n呜呜、小茜……不行了……（倒下）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bec35131440b3e92ba3db5d9edea5c0ea6951468f51b52dbfe60b6fac3b16351", "ja": "ええっ！？\nあ、茜、しっかりしろ！　茜！", "zh": "什么！？\n茜、茜，振作一点啊！茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2b7f60001cee33d8f06913b818a9c834c316865f04698556e32ac8719bb1eeac", "ja": "大変、茜ちゃんが倒れちゃった！\n{$P$}さん、早くプリン買ってきて！", "zh": "糟糕，小茜昏倒了！\n{$P$}先生，快点去买布丁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b632f1ec544fd357296a9fa587d252493047459576b82d4b4450d7d1a1a43de4", "ja": "わ、わかった！\n今すぐ買ってくるからな、待ってろよ、茜！", "zh": "好、好！\n我马上就去买，等我啊，茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1021_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "5fadb790224a657c525c59370dc16b91d08c40bc00fedd2c5eb37a5602f41cc6", "ja": "……ふぅ、なんとかごまかすのに成功したよ。", "zh": "……呼，总算是成功瞒过去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "344f62fa633ec0cba213762f83edb0693257adf20d2abfd45f374ef94324e7bc", "ja": "茜ちゃん達が恋愛するかもなんて聞いたら、\n{$P$}ちゃん、卒倒しちゃうからね！", "zh": "要是知道小茜我们想要谈恋爱，\n小{$P$}会昏倒的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "cbace516ed107bdbf3495874009ba6f1a13d9e384cffa2acad3007134533408f", "ja": "恋愛って……ほ、本気なんですか？\nでも、あ、アイドルは基本、恋愛禁止なんじゃ……？", "zh": "恋爱……真、真的要这样吗？\n可是，偶、偶像基本上不是禁止谈恋爱吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d0419fec1f0a93146b0a675664f5f1740fb5ea5369a2f53595b51c209e8d4cd7", "ja": "もちろん、スキャンダルはダメだよ。\nでも、知らなくていいってコトでもないと思う！", "zh": "当然不能搞出绯闻啊。\n不过，我觉得还是要了解一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bde486bee5f80b83e9716ca489136d2f6673cf6d1a99d0a7c57c5f8138d6fd20", "ja": "恋する女の子の気持ちを知ってたほうが、\nなんかいろいろ、これから役に立つと思いませんか？", "zh": "了解恋爱中的女孩是什么心情，\n对以后应该也有很多帮助吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1027_045kar", "source_sha256": "cc9ce8594ee026964fb22287bfe8778d9ee310a7400c0c3aadebfda329fb3457", "ja": "うぅ……た、たしかに、言われてみれば……\n私たちの楽曲は、恋愛の歌も多いですし……。", "zh": "呜呜……这、这么一说，确实是这样……\n而且我们的歌曲中也有很多情歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1028_023aka", "source_sha256": "8f0f0c74ce341ef291a8bcd9591bb7ef14653e4609b6089a6585320c31f31e63", "ja": "ハードルはまだあるよ、翼ちゃん、可憐ちゃん。\n恋愛するには、相手が必要なんじゃないかニャ？", "zh": "问题不只如此喔，小翼、小可怜。\n要谈恋爱的话，还需要有对象不是喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9ab480144555e1842fe0b90de66a6c84df24ac7f50139ec18d96e0c62ff180d9", "ja": "んー、そうなんですよね～。そこは仕方ないから、\n{$P$}さんで代用するしかないかな？", "zh": "嗯──说得也是呢～别无选择了，\n只能用{$P$}先生代替了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1030_045kar", "source_sha256": "d9cf4e85b3098bd80b60954b66ba43d3810cfe4136ab43f50899956b063d7fe2", "ja": "そ、そうですね。社長さんに、あまり\n失礼なことをするわけにもいきませんし……。", "zh": "是、是啊。毕竟也不能对社长，\n做这么失礼的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1031_023aka", "source_sha256": "4e0da07730658bf171429f41fecb4ba102b4e4bcee78dc939e979b26f77e6777", "ja": "う～ん……あっ、じゃあこういうのはどうかニャ？\n3人で{$P$}ちゃんに迫って……。", "zh": "唔……啊，不如这样喵？\n小茜我们三个对小{$P$}展开攻势……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1032_023aka", "source_sha256": "da575a0180d4db6bbadeafeafd7adc232180dae9b6219792e5a71b5dfbf68813", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんのハートを\n見事射止めた人が優勝～！とか。", "zh": "成功获得小{$P$}芳心的人\n就是赢家～！好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "62370df619472c766d976782b6ac0a4aa908eaf9f4c3a3b0a846af5b4a7a50f7", "ja": "うんうん、いいですね！　少女漫画ならたくさん\n読んでるから、アピールの仕方もばっちりわかるし！", "zh": "嗯嗯，很不错耶！我看过很多少女漫画，\n掌握了很多表现魅力的方法喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1034_045kar", "source_sha256": "0cc982090e661dc8ba804cc4db63d52d3e24cb3a14f67223cfa1852638c0dee8", "ja": "アピール、ですか……。\nじ、自信はありませんが、やってみます……！", "zh": "表现魅力、是吗……？\n我、我没什么自信，但会努力试试的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1035_023aka", "source_sha256": "4c207be1969ee9206f3f8746b3fe58e00e8db13187de600b2fb6c10b6a3be1e1", "ja": "それじゃ、{$P$}ちゃんが\n帰ってきたら作戦開始だよ！　みんなスタンバイだ！", "zh": "那么，等小{$P$}回来之后，\n就开始作战！大家就定位吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "25db584296991bb7afe00350722930893d5cdaf524ce2e5c0fe99eabd0590454", "ja": "ああ、みんなこんなところにいたのか。\nコンビニが混んでて時間がかかっちゃったけど、茜は？", "zh": "哦哦，原来你们在这里。\n便利商店好多人，所以花了点时间，茜呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1040_p", "source_sha256": "2a48c6ba5bf55f989f18cf523a64be859991299c36d566bd6fa67f876b07269c", "ja": "……ん？　あれ？　どうしたんだ、3人とも。黙って\nこっちをじ～っと見て……。な、なにか見えるのか？", "zh": "……嗯？奇怪？你们三个怎么了？\n怎么默默盯着我看……你、你们看到什么东西了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "63cdcb58e5747c51ec61177d189fb3aed238bde05ed86880b3f731214a9b4435", "ja": "{$P$}さんっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1042_p", "source_sha256": "39cc4fee670a5947e2c97e7791e25bc78cac81474310870ac8567140ff8abae5", "ja": "うわっ！？\nどうした、翼！？", "zh": "哇！？\n怎么了？翼！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1043_016tsu", "source_sha256": "88f68586bf69253531e1c8f98121cfe9a25e9614d844266002696302134dd2b1", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nわたし、すっごく胸が苦しいの……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n我觉得胸口好难受……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1044_p", "source_sha256": "86ca3572951159c8ebca976b7fdaac18584b20ea7a93409bbfdbe987c1a693f8", "ja": "え！？\n苦しいって……風邪か？　病院には行ったか？", "zh": "什么！？\n难受……感冒了吗？你去看医生了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1045_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f7a1b480d5fef06b2dbba83f45279b1793a86e544b7dcf76133380708687d7d8", "ja": "もう、そうじゃないってば～！", "zh": "真是的，不是那样啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1046_023aka", "source_sha256": "07a17a4860377b6140ab1f02c5f32ebc5604faa67733b3ac07ab77bed7b799b4", "ja": "ストップ、翼ちゃん！　ここは恋愛番長、\n野々原茜ちゃんにまかせてくれたまえよ……。", "zh": "停！小翼！接下来交给恋爱高手，\n野野原茜吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1047_023aka", "source_sha256": "c4e514c27e119751a11954a366de21096c906ad26bdb0f8d88b078f7b05e721d", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん……茜ちゃんの\nものになれ！　最高の贅沢を味あわせてあげよう！", "zh": "小{$P$}……成为小茜的人吧！\n小茜会让你品尝到最棒最奢华的飨宴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1048_p", "source_sha256": "8c28cc2769036f4d66b5b10837ec8dae7b868f7293d4ed480b1a8344d1ca5319", "ja": "あ、茜……急にどうしたんだ？　贅沢って、プリンか？\n俺の事はいいから、早く食べるんだ！", "zh": "茜、茜……你怎么突然这么说？奢华？你是说布丁吗？\n先别管我了，你快点吃布丁吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1049_045kar", "source_sha256": "2d4852d288da27546348c413fbc56c6ca25f9c471309a6505613a6c88351ea09", "ja": "あ、あのう、{$P$}さん……。\nすこしだけ、時間をいいですか……。", "zh": "那、那个，{$P$}先生……\n可以打扰一下吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1050_p", "source_sha256": "ce5c426dd95143f2f4277844bab0f10d81caa3268ef66cd42ac3f6973cfa2810", "ja": "可憐？", "zh": "可怜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1051_045kar", "source_sha256": "d6dabe65fb55bafe2b6125216182783dc3fe94d4eef9a26e74cb5dcb66017aea", "ja": "じ、自分のこと、ずっと前から好きやってん……。\nつ、付き合うてくれへん……？", "zh": "我、我从很久之前、就很喜欢你了嘿……\n可、可不可以和我交往啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1052_p", "source_sha256": "b2fd2d898657347a05192a3a46d816aa2a1ec6e3d9d77b927b39ff23de07c1e8", "ja": "なんで関西弁なんだ？\nまあ、ちょっとかわいいが……。", "zh": "你为什么说关西腔？\n不过，有点可爱呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1053_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fc779a12147022ca4f2f628d4defb0eaaface6d8d1acf82bb42857b0091e7c50", "ja": "あれ～？　{$P$}さん、\nあんまりドキドキしてないような……。", "zh": "奇怪了～{$P$}先生，\n你好像没有心跳加速的反应耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1054_p", "source_sha256": "170a751bfac3758ef6b12fecc56a03c39c0e132eea2b2ac0e50112876ddd43b5", "ja": "いや、ドキドキしてるけど……。\nみんな、悪いものでも食べたんじゃないだろうな？", "zh": "不，我有被吓得心跳加速没错……\n你们应该没吃到不干净的东西吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1055_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0b16dee4dd3367af4bc86398604ed0717a18501c369e6049707024e527112915", "ja": "そういうのじゃなくて～！", "zh": "不是那样啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1056_023aka", "source_sha256": "3a37126f6b8f78f082b28dce380ab13342314cf52eae26cc7644bfb5b81b4da7", "ja": "この茜ちゃんの魅力的なアピールが、微塵も\n通じないとは……！　思ったよりも手強いね！", "zh": "小茜的魅力攻势居然没有丝毫用处……！\n真是超乎想像地棘手呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1057_045kar", "source_sha256": "170d91e1243452a09e7a0d148236551629484dcdd0a8cb16bdbad03ff266e2f1", "ja": "や、やっぱり、私なんかがアピールしても……\nダメ、ですよね……うぅ……。", "zh": "果、果然，我这种人即使示好……\n也、没有用吧……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1058_p", "source_sha256": "59360263ac9bac5d62ca088fd7c0212786611f991545ab5a67ecffa3668c10f0", "ja": "（3人とも、なんだか落ち込んでいるみたいだけど……\n俺がいない間に、一体何があったんだ……？）", "zh": "（她们三个看起来好像很沮丧……\n我去买布丁时，究竟发生什么事了……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1059_p", "source_sha256": "91ec8e0f976af8fed87970ed4cee6a4304698a0c6a3844686a482a5bfd0149e9", "ja": "ん？　壁に虫が……季節外れの蚊みたいだな。\n可憐、ちょっと動かないでくれよ。", "zh": "嗯？墙上有只虫……看来是只季节错乱的蚊子。\n可怜，你先别乱动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1060_045kar", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_1061", "source_sha256": "33a02ddf03f90ed4f80d35c630f843fb8c51023a378e189e79b2011b9e0230f6", "ja": "虫を狙う", "zh": "瞄准虫", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_2000_p", "source_sha256": "75eb1c5beafbadac494a6e7a5e9ea6e8515f47f03cf7105b9967833af470452b", "ja": "えいっ！", "zh": "嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_2001_se", "source_sha256": "c87d313ee534d741cb20b6a8ebc144b9270c4c5b5eeed687184a6cbde0457de3", "ja": "ドンッ！", "zh": "咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_2002_045kar", "source_sha256": "c3e3c8dcc27ea1add4939e0dcb22081381019701afdc0dc8b1945f138506a090", "ja": "ひゃあっ……！\n{$P$}さん……！？", "zh": "哇啊……！\n{$P$}先生……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_2003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "951aef1ad5a40775de7c0a9cc6d260bff37f5fad439c5a659ba544544c4aeee2", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、\n可憐さんを壁ドン！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n居然对可怜壁咚！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_2004_p", "source_sha256": "43298afffad1d5d93c708a677cd6fe705e7789fc8bbcbc1cc63567f6848045e0", "ja": "おっ、取れた取れた……\nすまないな可憐、びっくりしたか？", "zh": "喔！抓到了抓到了……\n抱歉，可怜，吓到你了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_2005_045kar", "source_sha256": "9b80fe74bcde8b53247ed75b8f3f9f621311a5572b925abf032fa8736f0d981c", "ja": "び、びっくりというか……私……\nど、ドキドキしてしまって……うう……。", "zh": "与、与其说是吓到……感觉……\n我、我更像是心跳加速了……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_2006_023aka", "source_sha256": "16b4dedd8d61b6ee83658e03ba1a07895b71dde2993a9450904aeb39698883e5", "ja": "ぐぬぬ……{$P$}ちゃんめ、\n意外とやるな……！", "zh": "唔唔唔……小{$P$}好样的，\n居然这么厉害……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_2008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d06a22a51c1e23eace7ecf4b4edd8fef94720be0584e1ddef20cb3079ca815eb", "ja": "う～……やっぱりわたしたちじゃ、\n大人の男の人にはかなわないのかな……？", "zh": "呜……\n我们果然不是成年男人的对手吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_2009_p", "source_sha256": "01dfe89da7040b82b5d1aec5308585398b445932101dff128ccaedc0b5f93f6a", "ja": "どうしたんだ、みんな。\nプリン食べないのか？", "zh": "大家这是怎么了？\n你们不吃布丁吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_2010_023aka", "source_sha256": "75d6643a45ba19928cd8737b6f21d239d494989fb6f052928fa859f1faa40906", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんにドキドキさせられてる\nようじゃ、まだまだ修行不足ってコトだね……。", "zh": "居然会被小{$P$}弄得心跳加速，\n这表示小茜我们的功夫还不到家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_2011_045kar", "source_sha256": "22ab5c8bd5a852e62af913644141d2a0bed4e9674fbc0ed7acf4a6dbecb08dee", "ja": "『りるきゃん』のイメージモデルとして、\nも、もっと、経験を積まなくちゃ……。", "zh": "作为《莉露甜心》的形象模特儿，\n必、必须累积更多经验才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_2012_023aka", "source_sha256": "1d40dcc22bc1fe1a089dd7a24494c9f33379875f6bf5a6f986079bab84ec8edd", "ja": "腹が減っては修行はできないっ！\n{$P$}ちゃん、プリンはいただくよ！", "zh": "肚子饿了就无法修行！\n小{$P$}，小茜我们要吃布丁啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_2013_p", "source_sha256": "533c9eb501220d70991534f3f382c7334558d81335cd84862baad7ae08d38766", "ja": "ああ、どんどん食べてくれ。\nちゃんと3人分買ってきたからな！", "zh": "好啊，你们尽管吃吧。\n我买了三人份！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_04_2014_p", "source_sha256": "51c39a772ca996a87ffb79275df0df6454ceb7915f6a6763b5e756445ba326b2", "ja": "（3人とも、なんだか様子がおかしかったが……\nそれだけ、お腹が空いていたのかもしれないな）", "zh": "（她们三个感觉怪怪的……\n不过可能是因为她们饿昏头了吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
